  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Link UP 2: Strengthening CSOs to deliver violence prevention interventions to build youth resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Specific Objectives/Outcomes are: 1) to reduce the vulnerability to violence of medium-to-high risk youth in four communities undergoing enhanced security measures using resilience-building, asset-based activities and parental support; and 2) to strengthen the capacity of CSOs and NGOs working in 10 communities undergoing enhanced security measures to design, deliver and measure collaborative programming in violence prevention.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
